'' TKO0820 -- fbc's error 20 -- for an arithmetic, bitwise or shift operator over two strings,
'' and for a compound assignment with a string on either side. A C-style escaped quote in a
'' plain string, '"A( \"\" ) b"', lexes as '"A( \"' '\' '"" ) b"': a string integer-divided by
'' a string, which Check left untyped and lowering then stopped on as TKO0994 ("this
'' N_AMBIGUOUS was not compiled"; N_INTRINSIC inside 'print'). 's -= "b"' and the other
'' compounds over a string target were TKO0994 too, and 'n += "3"' / 'n *= "3"' compiled.
'' See UdtArith_ and CheckStrCompound_, proccheck.tiko.
''
'' MEASURED, fbc 1.10.1 with -maxerr inf over the source, 2026-11-22: error 20 on exactly
'' lines 7-16. Lines 17-20 -- '+', '&' and the relational operators over strings, 's += "b"',
'' 's &= 1', 'w += s' -- are accepted.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -fmax-errors 100 -c tests/diagnostics/src/string-arith-operands.bas -o tests/diagnostics/src/string-arith-operands.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(7,12): error TKO0820: no operator '\' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(8,13): error TKO0820: no operator '\' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(9,9): error TKO0820: no operator '*' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(10,9): error TKO0820: no operator 'mod' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(11,9): error TKO0820: no operator 'and' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(12,1): error TKO0820: no operator '-' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(13,1): error TKO0820: no operator '\' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(14,1): error TKO0820: no operator '+' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(15,1): error TKO0820: no operator '*' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-arith-operands.bas(16,1): error TKO0820: no operator '+' takes these operand types
'' EXPECT-NOT: string-arith-operands.bas(17,
'' EXPECT-NOT: string-arith-operands.bas(18,
'' EXPECT-NOT: string-arith-operands.bas(19,
'' EXPECT-NOT: string-arith-operands.bas(20,
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 10
